 Next.js Google OAuth Authentication System

A robust, Full-Stack Next.js application implementing secure user authentication via Google OAuth 2.0. This project demonstrates advanced backend routing, session management, and secure handling of user profile states.

 Project Access
Due to GitHub web interface limitations regarding Next.js build caches and security scanning configurations, the complete production-ready codebase is securely hosted and maintained on Google Drive.

 Access Full Source Code Here:https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZVvyByVTmvILL5fnF1-2PNIqfRn9nCGe?usp=drive_link
Or  You can  Directly see  the  work  vidio presentation  clicking on  the  link https://youtu.be/6fCDRCnaGsE


 Core Features
* **Secure Google OAuth Integrated:** Powered by NextAuth / Google Identity Services for seamless and secure sign-in and sign-out capabilities.
* **Dynamic Profile Rendering:** Automatically fetches and displays authenticated user metrics, including full name, verified email, and profile avatar.
* **State & Session Persistence:** Robust handling of protected backend layout routes (`/app`, `/api/auth`) ensuring unauthorized users cannot access inner dashboard modules.
* **Modern Tech Stack:** Next.js (App Router), Tailwind CSS for streamlined responsive styling, and JavaScript (ES6+). 
